  "releaseNotes": "OpenMaui 10.0.110.9:\n- Pages with many shapes, BoxViews, GraphicsViews or DrawingViews redrew and resized slowly\n- Resizing a window echoed its new size back as a size request\n- MAUI's layout instrumentation ran on every Measure and Arrange\n- Typeface lookups built a string on every call\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/open-maui/maui-linux/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
